  "title": "Pin codex to o4-mini in osf.toml",
  "summary": "A three-line addition to osf.toml names an explicit model for the codex review agent. Previously codex fell through to its own built-in default (gpt-6-astra), which the review environment's API key rejected with a 401; the config now routes codex to o4-mini, a model that key can use. Nothing else in the agent roster or the review pipeline changes — claude and opencode keep their existing model assignments.",
